ろしくお願いいたします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pppppks_/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db2d8375/uploads/origins/0fa1ac0c-86d8-4f58-9f25-7c2b816f3b84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a718b4853ca08e1471d31ada4e2182b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db2d8375/uploads/origins/0fa1ac0c-86d8-4f58-9f25-7c2b816f3b84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a718b4853ca08e1471d31ada4e2182b, https://si.imgix.net/db2d8375/uploads/origins/0fa1ac0c-86d8-4f58-9f25-7c2b816f3b84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e1d55e4eac83d2ed669e6e08119d238 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db2d8375/uploads/origins/0fa1ac0c-86d8-4f58-9f25-7c2b816f3b84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7ac456337cebb2e2a471199c8aca132 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "小夜ちゃん描いて欲しいです\n構図等はおまかせします\n\nhttps://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp/dormitory/sayo/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pppppks_/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9727e9a/uploads/origins/a01f0765-7094-4a2a-81b6-d1b0dc78227f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e45a19724cd597ca5eb3fea4f4f23f7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9727e9a/uploads/origins/a01f0765-7094-4a2a-81b6-d1b0dc78227f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e45a19724cd597ca5eb3fea4f4f23f7, https://si.imgix.net/d9727e9a/uploads/origins/a01f0765-7094-4a2a-81b6-d1b0dc78227f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=294bb1660f2de0d5bf4f99acc1730958 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9727e9a/uploads/origins/a01f0765-7094-4a2a-81b6-d1b0dc78227f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ae8be292e6a71db75b38f94730d4422 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "まんぷくちゃんさん、こんばんは！\n\n先日の秋例大祭では、ありがとうございました！\nおかげさまで